# The wasm blob + manifest are copied here from the top-level `dist/engine-wasm-ffi/`
# by `npm run sync-wasm` (which runs automatically before `build` and `test`). They
# are packaged into the tarball at publish time. Do not hand-edit — regenerate via
# `make engine-wasm-ffi-dist` from the repo root, then re-run sync-wasm here.
*
!.gitignore
